# Software diagram.
# Command to generate the diagram (.svg format)
# d2 --pad=10 --dark-theme=200 -w -l=tala software_diagram.d2

shape: sequence_diagram

audio: Audio Controller
display: Display Controller
led: LED Strip Controller

audio."Samples audio (length of 1 second) and processes it via FFT.\nPresents clean data for other controllers."
audio <-> display: Calls a getter method(s) for the processed data, which it then uses.
display."Visualizes the data on the Nokia SPI display."
audio <-> led: Calls a getter method(s) for the processed data, which it then uses.
led."Visualizes the data on the NeoPixel LED strip."




